      "body": "## Overview\n\nPass the configured `hf3fs_metadata_server_url` to `Hf3fsMetadataClient` in both scheduler and worker initialization in `HF3FSKVConnector`. Fixes #62387.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Fixes issue #62387 where `HF3FSKVConnector` silently ignored `hf3fs_metadata_server_url` and defaulted to `http://localhost:18000`.\n- Adds unit tests in `TestHF3FSKVConnectorMetadataServerUrl` verifying both scheduler and worker roles pass the configured URL.\n- Guards `signal.SIGQUIT` registration with `hasattr` to prevent crashes on non-POSIX platforms.\n\n## Validation\n\nRan unit tests with pytest on the new and existing test suites:\n```bash\npytest tests/v1/kv_connector/unit/test_hf3fs_connector.py -k \"TestHF3FSKVConnectorMetadataServerUrl\" -v\n",
